# CR 702.11b/e: Hexproof's Activator$ Opponent gate (playerCantBeTargetedBy,
# staticability.go) only ever refuses an opponent's spell or ability --
# human's own Lightning Bolt at human, both granted by human's own Leyline
# of Sanctity, stays a legal target throughout, so Bolt resolves normally.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 R
queue targets human
queue action human cast 3
passpriority
